 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Totally understandable. The key is taking short breaks often. A five minute break every hour can keep momentum going. Another way to look at it is, are you taking enough breaks from being active? Sitting all day is worse for your body. Get up, move around bit, stretch, yawn. It helps remind your body that you' still alive. Not yet. A quick walk or some deep breathing is more active. Lovely simple as is a cup of tea. Take a quick walk after the afternoon session.",
